Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

Congratulations on your admission to Arizona State University. I am pleased to inform you that you have been selected for our New American University Plus Scholarship!

This new scholarship will be renewable for three years for a four-year total award. You can review your awards on My ASU at https://my.asu.edu and learn more about the conditions for renewal on ASU's Scholarship Renewal Guide at https://students.asu.edu/scholarships/renewal. 

Please let me know if you have any additional questions about this scholarship or your next steps for enrolling at ASU.

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}


If you would like any additional information or have questions related to this subject, please reply to this email.

